# Settings screen template

When the user asks for a **settings template**, **settings screen**, or a new
full-screen settings-style page, follow this contract. Do **not** reinvent
header/scroll/section chrome.

## Source of truth

| Piece | File |
|---|---|
| Layout + grouped primitives | `components/SettingsInsetGrouped.tsx` |
| Full-screen wrapper | `components/SettingsScreenLayout.tsx` |
| Bottom-sheet consumer | `components/SupportSheet.tsx` |
| Reference consumer | `app/scenes.tsx` |
| Color tokens | `.cursor/rules/bottom-sheet-tokens.mdc` |

## Required structure (full-screen)

```tsx
import SettingsScreenLayout, {
  SettingsScreenSection,
} from "@/components/SettingsScreenLayout";

export default function ExampleSettingsScreen() {
  return (
    <SettingsScreenLayout
      title="Example"
      onClose={() => router.back() /* or router.push("/") */}
      closeTestID="example.close-button"
      closeAccessibilityLabel="Done"
    >
      <SettingsScreenSection title="Section Name">
        {/* pickers / rows / content */}
      </SettingsScreenSection>
    </SettingsScreenLayout>
  );
}
```

## Bottom sheet (Support pattern)

```tsx
<BaseBottomSheet ref={ref} headerless snapPoints={["90%"]}>
  <SettingsInsetGroupedLayout
    title="Support"
    onDone={() => ref.current?.close()}
    variant="bottomSheet"
    doneTestID="support.done-button"
  >
    <SettingsGroupedSection title="Contact Us">
      <SettingsGroupedRow title="..." icon={{ name, backgroundColor }} onPress={...} />
    </SettingsGroupedSection>
  </SettingsInsetGroupedLayout>
</BaseBottomSheet>
```

## Rules

1. **Full-screen routes** use `SettingsScreenLayout` — Done top-right, large title that collapses on scroll.
2. **Bottom sheets** use `BaseBottomSheet` with `headerless` + `SettingsInsetGroupedLayout` `variant="bottomSheet"`.
3. **Sections** use `SettingsScreenSection` / `SettingsGroupedSection` — uppercase label + white inset card.
4. **Tappable links** use `SettingsGroupedRow` with icon badge + chevron.
5. **Tokens:** `bottomSheetText`, `bottomSheetSecondaryText`, `bottomSheetSeparator`, `systemGroupedBg`, `systemSecondaryGroupedBg`. Never scene/accent tokens.
6. Prefer existing pickers with `variant="bottomSheet"` over one-off controls.
7. Carousels: set `overflowVisible` on the section wrapping horizontal scroll content.
8. Add `testID` + `accessibilityLabel` on Done when Maestro-reachable.

## Out of scope

- In-session `SettingsSheet` (gorhom sheet, legacy header) — migrate later.
- Breathing session chrome / home pager.
